<div class="hc-topic" id="st-overview">
    <h3><x-icon name="graduation-cap" /> No account needed</h3>
    <p>Students and research groups do <strong>not</strong> have accounts and never sign in. Everything you need is public:</p>
    <ol class="hc-steps">
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">1</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="grid" /> Find your category</div><p class="hc-step-text">From the home page choose <strong>Student / Research Group</strong> to see every presentation category that is currently listed.</p></div></li>
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">2</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="file-plus" /> Register once, as a group</div><p class="hc-step-text">The group leader fills in one registration for the whole group while registration is open.</p></div></li>
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">3</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="hash" /> Keep your group reference</div><p class="hc-step-text">A reference such as <code>CFD-2026-0012</code> identifies your group from now on.</p></div></li>
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">4</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="calendar" /> Watch the schedule</div><p class="hc-step-text">After registration closes the system assigns your room, day and time. Check the schedule for your place in the queue and live updates.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
</div>

<div class="hc-topic" id="st-categories">
    <h3><x-icon name="grid" /> Browsing presentation categories</h3>
    <p>A <strong>presentation category</strong> is one presentation event — for example "Capstone Final Defense". Each one is shown as a card:</p>
    <figure class="hc-figure">
        <div class="hc-window">
            <div class="hc-window-bar"><div class="hc-window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="hc-window-url">/categories</div></div>
            <div class="hc-screen is-tinted">
                <div class="m-card" style="max-width:24rem;">
                    <div class="m-between"><span class="m-title">Capstone Final Defense</span><span class="hc-badge hc-badge-success">Registration Open</span><span class="m-pin">1</span></div>
                    <div class="m-muted m-small">A.Y. 2026–2027 · First Semester · College of Computing and Information Sciences</div>
                    <div class="m-pills" style="margin:.45rem 0;"><span class="hc-badge hc-badge-brand">Standard</span><span class="hc-badge hc-badge-muted">Track</span><span class="hc-badge hc-badge-muted">Technical Adviser</span><span class="hc-badge hc-badge-muted">Payment</span><span class="m-pin">2</span></div>
                    <div class="m-grid-2 m-small"><div><div class="m-label">Registration Closes</div>Oct 10, 2026 · 5:00 PM</div><div><div class="m-label">Schedule</div>Oct 20 – Oct 22, 2026</div></div>
                    <div class="m-row" style="margin-top:.6rem;"><span class="m-btn"><x-icon name="file-plus" /> Register</span><span class="m-btn is-ghost"><x-icon name="calendar" /> Schedule</span><span class="m-btn is-ghost">More Details</span><span class="m-pin">3</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption><strong>Figure 4.</strong> A presentation category card.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ul class="hc-pins">
        <li><span class="m-pin">1</span><span><strong>Registration status</strong> — Opens Soon, Registration Open or Registration Closed.</span></li>
        <li><span class="m-pin">2</span><span><strong>Mode and requirements</strong> — what the form will ask for (track, technical adviser, payment).</span></li>
        <li><span class="m-pin">3</span><span><strong>Actions</strong> — Register (only while open), view the Schedule (always), or More Details for the full description, dates, payment instructions and announcements.</span></li>
    </ul>
    <h4>Presentation modes</h4>
    <div class="hc-options-or">
        <div class="hc-option"><div class="hc-option-icon"><x-icon name="file-text" /></div><div><div class="hc-option-title">Standard</div><p>Your group presents one project, under one <strong>Project Title</strong>. Panelists rate the project and each member.</p></div></div>
        <div class="hc-or">or</div>
        <div class="hc-option"><div class="hc-option-icon"><x-icon name="list-check" /></div><div><div class="hc-option-title">Title Proposal</div><p>Your group submits a set number of <strong>Proposed Titles</strong>; the panel evaluates each and approves one.</p></div></div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="hc-topic" id="st-register">
    <h3><x-icon name="file-plus" /> Registering your group</h3>
    <p>Only the <strong>group leader</strong> registers, once, for the whole group. Press <strong>Register</strong> on the category card while registration is open.</p>
    <figure class="hc-figure">
        <div class="hc-window">
            <div class="hc-window-bar"><div class="hc-window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="hc-window-url">/categories/capstone-final-defense/register</div></div>
            <div class="hc-screen">
                <div class="m-title" style="margin-bottom:.5rem;">Group Registration</div>
                <div class="m-label" style="margin-bottom:.3rem;">Group Leader <span class="m-pin">1</span></div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1.2fr 1.2fr .5fr .5fr 1fr;gap:.35rem;">
                    <div class="m-field"><span>Last Name *</span><span class="m-input">Dela Cruz</span></div>
                    <div class="m-field"><span>First Name *</span><span class="m-input">Juan</span></div>
                    <div class="m-field"><span>Middle Name *</span><span class="m-input">Santos</span></div>
                    <div class="m-field"><span>Sex *</span><span class="m-input">M</span></div>
                    <div class="m-field"><span>Section *</span><span class="m-input">4B</span></div>
                    <div class="m-field"><span>Track *</span><span class="m-input">Web ▾</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="m-label" style="margin:.7rem 0 .3rem;">Group Members <span class="m-pin">2</span></div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1.2fr 1.2fr 1.2fr .5fr .5fr 1fr;gap:.35rem;align-items:center;">
                    <span class="m-xs m-muted">1</span><span class="m-input">Reyes</span><span class="m-input">Ana</span><span class="m-input">Lopez</span><span class="m-input">F</span><span class="m-input">4B</span><span class="m-input">Web ▾</span>
                    <span class="m-xs m-muted">2</span><span class="m-input is-empty">Last</span><span class="m-input is-empty">First</span><span class="m-input is-empty">Middle</span><span class="m-input is-empty">–</span><span class="m-input is-empty">4B</span><span class="m-input is-empty">Track</span>
                </div>
                <div class="m-label" style="margin:.7rem 0 .3rem;">Project Information <span class="m-pin">3</span></div>
                <div class="m-grid-2"><div class="m-field"><span>Project Title *</span><span class="m-input">Smart Campus Navigation App</span></div><div class="m-field"><span>Technical Adviser *</span><span class="m-input">Engr. M. Santos</span></div></div>
                <div class="m-row" style="justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:.7rem;"><span class="m-btn"><x-icon name="eye" /> Review &amp; Submit</span><span class="m-pin">4</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption><strong>Figure 5.</strong> The registration form for a Standard category that requires a track and a technical adviser.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ol class="hc-steps">
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">1</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="user" /> Group Leader</div><p class="hc-step-text">Last, first and middle name, sex, section and — when the category asks for it — your research track. All required.</p></div></li>
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">2</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="users" /> Group Members</div><p class="hc-step-text">One row per member. The number of rows is the category's maximum group size minus the leader. Leave unused rows completely blank; a row you start must be filled in completely.</p></div></li>
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">3</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="file-text" /> Project Information</div><p class="hc-step-text">Standard: your <strong>Project Title</strong>. Title Proposal: exactly the required number of <strong>Proposed Titles</strong>. Plus your technical adviser if the category requires one.</p></div></li>
        <li class="hc-step"><div class="hc-step-marker">4</div><div class="hc-step-body"><div class="hc-step-head"><x-icon name="eye" /> Review &amp; Submit</div><p class="hc-step-text">The form checks everything, then shows a summary. Read it carefully. Choose <strong>Back to Edit</strong> to fix something, or <strong>Confirm &amp; Submit</strong> to register.</p><div class="hc-result">Registration <x-icon name="arrow-right" /> <span class="hc-badge hc-badge-success">Registration Recorded</span></div></div></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="hc-note hc-note-danger"><x-icon name="alert-triangle" /><p><span class="hc-note-title">You cannot edit a registration after submitting.</span> If something is wrong — a misspelled name, a missing member, a wrong title — ask your Administrator to correct it. Do not register a second time.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="hc-topic" id="st-rules">
    <h3><x-icon name="list-check" /> Registration rules</h3>
    <div class="hc-table-wrap">
        <table class="hc-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Rule</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>Names</td><td>Letters only; spaces, hyphens, apostrophes and periods are allowed. Names are tidied automatically (extra spaces removed, each word capitalised).</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Section</td><td>A year level and a letter — <code>4B</code>, <code>3A</code>. No program prefix. Letters are capitalised for you, so <code>4b</code> and <code>4 - b</code> both become <code>4B</code>.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Sex</td><td>Male or Female.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Track</td><td>Shown only when the category requires it. If the category has a track list, choose from it; your group is scheduled into a room for its track.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Members</td><td>A row is either completely blank (skipped) or completely filled. The same person cannot appear twice in a group.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Proposed Titles</td><td>Title Proposal categories only — exactly the number shown on the form.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Duplicates</td><td>A category refuses a second active registration with the same leader name, or (Standard mode) the same project title.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Window</td><td>Registration is accepted only between the category's opening and closing date and time.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="hc-topic" id="st-confirmation">
    <h3><x-icon name="hash" /> Your group reference</h3>
    <p>After submitting you see <strong>Registration Recorded</strong> with your group's details and its <strong>group reference</strong>:</p>
    <figure class="hc-figure">
        <div class="hc-window">
            <div class="hc-window-bar"><div class="hc-window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="hc-window-url">…/register/confirmation/CFD-2026-0012</div></div>
