                    <div class="m-avatar" style="margin:0 auto .35rem;background:var(--hc-success-tint);color:var(--hc-success);width:1.8rem;height:1.8rem;"><x-icon name="check" /></div>
                    <div class="m-title">Registration Recorded</div>
                    <div class="m-label" style="margin-top:.4rem;">Group Reference</div>
                    <div style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--hc-accent);">CFD-2026-0012</div>
                    <div class="m-muted m-small" style="margin:.3rem 0 .5rem;">Capstone Final Defense · Standard</div>
                    <span class="m-btn"><x-icon name="calendar" /> View Schedule</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption><strong>Figure 6.</strong> The confirmation page.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="hc-note hc-note-tip"><x-icon name="lightbulb" /><p>Take a screenshot of this page or write the reference down. It is the quickest way for an Administrator to find your group. You can always find your group again by searching your leader's name or project title on the schedule page.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="hc-topic" id="st-schedule">
    <h3><x-icon name="calendar" /> Viewing the schedule and queue</h3>
    <p>Press <strong>Schedule</strong> on the category card (or <strong>View Schedule</strong> after registering). Before the queue is generated, rooms show "Queue not generated yet for this room."</p>
    <figure class="hc-figure">
        <div class="hc-window">
            <div class="hc-window-bar"><div class="hc-window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="hc-window-url">/categories/capstone-final-defense/schedule</div></div>
            <div class="hc-screen">
                <div class="m-grid-2" style="grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr;align-items:start;">
                    <div class="m-col">
                        <div class="m-row"><span class="m-input is-empty m-grow">Search by leader name or project title</span><span class="m-btn"><x-icon name="search" /></span><span class="m-pin">1</span></div>
                        <div class="m-tabs"><span class="is-on">Room 101</span><span>Room 102</span><span class="m-pin" style="padding:0">2</span></div>
                        <div class="m-row"><span class="m-seg"><span class="is-on">Scheduled</span><span>Completed</span><span>Deferred</span></span><span class="m-pin">3</span></div>
                        <table class="m-table">
                            <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Date</th><th>Time</th><th>Group</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr class="is-now"><td>4</td><td>Oct 20</td><td>9:00 AM</td><td>CFD-2026-0007 <span class="hc-badge hc-badge-success">Ongoing</span></td></tr>
                                <tr><td>5</td><td>Oct 20</td><td>9:20 AM</td><td>CFD-2026-0012 <span class="hc-badge hc-badge-brand">Called</span></td></tr>
                                <tr><td>6</td><td>Oct 20</td><td>9:40 AM</td><td>CFD-2026-0003</td></tr>
                                <tr><td>7</td><td>Oct 20</td><td>10:00 AM</td><td>CFD-2026-0018</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
